    "job_landscape": {
      "title": "Landscape Architect",
      "description": "<h2>About the role</h2><p>Design green spaces that keep the native trees at the heart of each community.</p><h3>What you will do</h3><ul><li><p>Prepare landscape concepts and working drawings</p></li><li><p>Select native plant species with the horticulture team</p></li><li><p>Coordinate with civil teams during execution</p></li></ul><h3>What we are looking for</h3><ul><li><p>B.Arch / M.Arch with landscape specialisation</p></li><li><p>Portfolio of residential or township projects</p></li></ul><p>We offer a competitive salary, performance incentives and medical cover for your family.</p>",
