      "description": "<h2>About the role</h2><p>Learn performance marketing on live real estate campaigns across Google and Meta.</p><h3>What you will do</h3><ul><li><p>Help set up and monitor lead-generation campaigns</p></li><li><p>Prepare weekly reports on cost per lead</p></li><li><p>Test ad creatives with the design team</p></li></ul><h3>What we are looking for</h3><ul><li><p>Final-year student or recent graduate</p></li><li><p>Interest in digital marketing and analytics</p></li></ul><p>We offer a competitive salary, performance incentives and medical cover for your family.</p>",
