      "description": "<h2>About the role</h2><p>Handle day-to-day accounting for project accounts.</p><h3>What you will do</h3><ul><li><p>Maintain ledgers and vendor payments</p></li><li><p>Support GST and TDS filings</p></li></ul><h3>What we are looking for</h3><ul><li><p>B.Com / M.Com</p></li><li><p>Tally experience</p></li></ul><p>We offer a competitive salary, performance incentives and medical cover for your family.</p>",
